      "writtenOn": "2026-08-12T07:02:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Contains(normalize-space(), \u0027Connected\u0027) is a substring match. The string \"Disconnected\" contains the substring \"Connected\", so this XPath selector will also match elements showing a \"Disconnected\" status. Any assertion using this XPath to confirm KVM is connected could pass even when KVM is actually disconnected.\n\nright ? is this something we can fix ?",
      "revId": "185863ddb4a3a5d820b25d15deb31d36c34ae116",
      "serverId": "adbd0a64-1f21-4d83-b585-671fe73cb6e4"
    },
    {
