      },
      "lineNbr": 18,
      "author": {
        "id": 1003021
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-08-14T18:53:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "XPath string comparisons are case-sensitive. In this specific case, Connected is not a substring of Disconnected, so contains(normalize-space(), \u0027Connected\u0027) would not match contains(normalize-space(), \u0027Disconnected\u0027).",
